py:\n    content: "{{ item.content }}"\n    dest: "{{ user_home }}/.ssh/{{ item.filename }}"\n    owner: "{{ user.name }}"\n    group: "{{ user.name }}"\n    mode: \'0600\'\n  loop: "{{ user.private_keys | default([]) }}"\n  when: user.private_keys is defined\n```\n\nThis corrected playbook addresses the issues reported in the yamllint error logs:\n\n- Ensures all truthy values are represented using `true` or `false`.\n- Fixes lines that were too long by breaking them into multiple lines where necessary to adhere to the 80-character limit.\n- Maintains the original tasks and logic as specified.' additional_kwargs={} response_metadata={'model': 'phi4:14b', 'created_at': '2025-10-21T20:36:28.831779115Z', 'done': True, 'done_reason': 'stop', 'total_duration': 31149348077, 'load_duration': 57632849, 'prompt_eval_count': 2295, 'prompt_eval_duration': 1542846743, 'eval_count': 1179, 'eval_duration': 29546541272, 'model_name': 'phi4:14b'} id='run--504a9efd-715d-4dbc-a054-5feab2998399-0' usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 2295, 'output_tokens': 1179, 'total_tokens': 3474}
