te key file for user\n  copy:\n    content: "{{ item.content }}"\n    dest: "{{ user_home }}/.ssh/{{ item.filename }}"\n    owner: "{{ user.name }}"\n    group: "{{ user.name }}"\n    mode: \'0600\'\n  loop: "{{ user.private_keys | default([]) }}"\n  when: user.private_keys is defined\n```\n\nThis corrected Ansible playbook addresses the yamllint errors identified:\n- For the `when` condition truthy values, added `is defined` to ensure proper evaluation.\n- Shortened lines to adhere to the 80-character limit by removing unnecessary spaces or breaking expressions into multiple lines where applicable.' additional_kwargs={} response_metadata={'model': 'phi4:14b', 'created_at': '2025-10-21T20:36:56.847193909Z', 'done': True, 'done_reason': 'stop', 'total_duration': 27819799344, 'load_duration': 58607399, 'prompt_eval_count': 2293, 'prompt_eval_duration': 68347752, 'eval_count': 1175, 'eval_duration': 27691378996, 'model_name': 'phi4:14b'} id='run--2b0313c6-da36-4a57-8ed7-f79f4178961c-0' usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 2293, 'output_tokens': 1175, 'total_tokens': 3468}
