tart and enable httpd\n  service:\n    name: "{{ httpd_service }}"\n    state: started\n    enabled: yes\n```\n\n### Corrections Made:\n- Changed `when: https_ssl_enable` to `when: https_ssl_enable is true` to conform to YAML linting rules regarding truthy values.' additional_kwargs={} response_metadata={'model': 'phi4:14b', 'created_at': '2025-10-21T20:42:17.441039755Z', 'done': True, 'done_reason': 'stop', 'total_duration': 15049061018, 'load_duration': 60286537, 'prompt_eval_count': 1356, 'prompt_eval_duration': 7147080, 'eval_count': 564, 'eval_duration': 14980071209, 'model_name': 'phi4:14b'} id='run--c7a64303-f4b6-45e2-b607-e4def77cd811-0' usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 1356, 'output_tokens': 564, 'total_tokens': 1920}
