content='```yaml\n---\n- name: Set the ansible_package_state fact\n  set_fact:\n    ansible_package_state: "{{ \'present\' if ansible_install_method == \'package\' else \'absent\' }}"\n\n- name: Set up Ansible on RedHat\n  include_tasks: setup-RedHat.yml\n  when: ansible_os_family == \'RedHat\' and ansible_distribution != \'Fedora\' and ansible_install_method == \'package\'\n\n- name: Set up Ansible on Fedora\n  include_tasks: setup-Fedora.yml\n  when: ansible_distribution == \'Fedora\' and ansible_install_method == \'package\'\n\n- name: Set up Ansible on Ubuntu\n  include_tasks: setup-Ubuntu.yml\n  when: ansible_distribution == \'Ubuntu\' and ansible_install_method == \'package\'\n\n- name: Set up Ansible on Debian\n  include_tasks: setup-Debian.yml\n  when: ansible_distribution == \'Debian\' and ansible_install_method == \'package\'\n\n- name: Set up Ansible using Pip\n  include_tasks: setup-pip.yml\n  when: ansible_install_method == \'pip\'\n```\n\nThis playbook is structured to be included in an Ansible Role under the `tasks/main.yml` directory. It adheres to the specified task descriptions and conditions, ensuring that each task is executed based on the given criteria.' additional_kwargs={} response_metadata={'model': 'phi4:14b', 'created_at': '2025-10-21T21:42:43.655067231Z', 'done': True, 'done_reason': 'stop', 'total_duration': 5133524193, 'load_duration': 58719369, 'prompt_eval_count': 523, 'prompt_eval_duration': 284552538, 'eval_count': 279, 'eval_duration': 4788893108, 'model_name': 'phi4:14b'} id='run--8b2b6d5e-59b3-407f-8c14-1e1ce27ccd30-0' usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 523, 'output_tokens': 279, 'total_tokens': 802}
